{comment: Verse}
E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 B/D# E
1. Renew, restore, revive Your church and make us whole.
2. Ignite, transform, take us to a place we’ve never seen before.

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
B C#m 7 A 2
You’ve done the impossible.
B C#m 7 F#m 7 E 2 /G# B sus B
Your word is unstoppable, with expectation we declare.

{comment: Chorus}
E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 B/D# E
Though mountains stand before us. Though weapons form against us.
E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 B/D# E B/D# E F#m 7 E
We’re standing on Your promise. We’re believing You, Lord, for greater things.
E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 B/D# E
We know that You are willing. We’ve seen that You are able.
E 2 /G# A 2 B C#m 7 B/D# E B/D# E F#m 7 E
Oh God, release Your favor. We’re believing You, Lord, for greater things.

